# Artificial Evolution changes the text of Bot1's Figure of Fable, Scout to Elf (CR 612.1), so the card does what the
# changed text says: its first stage makes it a 2/3 Kithkin Elf, and the second stage, "if this creature is a Scout",
# now asks whether it is an Elf and makes it a 4/5 Kithkin Soldier (CR 612). It never becomes a Scout.

